# Clinical Safety

<!-- merged from: atlas/07-atlas-clinical-safety -->

- Safety-critical fields must block form submission if empty. Never silently default.
- Cross-tenant access is a critical hazard. Treat as a P0 incident.
- AI outputs must show confidence, allow human override, and log Provenance.
- Escalation paths must exist for safety netting. Never swallow safety alerts.
- Class C changes need Clinical Safety Officer (CSO) review before merging.
